@startuml diagramme-sequence-gestion-convocations-p2
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow false

<style>
title {
  FontSize 32
  FontStyle bold
  Margin 8
}
document {
  FontSize 26
}
sequenceDiagram {
  actor {
    FontSize 28
    FontStyle bold
    Padding 10
  }
  participant {
    FontSize 26
    FontStyle bold
    Padding 10
  }
  arrow {
    FontSize 26
    LineThickness 2
  }
  divider {
    FontSize 24
    FontStyle bold
  }
  lifeLine {
    LineThickness 2
  }
}
</style>

title Gestion des convocations (2/3) — Consulter un PDF

actor "Gestionnaire" as Gest
participant "Application\nweb (React)" as React
participant "Passerelle" as GW
participant "Convocations" as Conv

== Consulter un PDF ==

Gest -> React : Clique « Voir le PDF »
React -> GW : GET /api/convocations/\n{numeroInscription}/pdf
GW -> Conv : Transmet la demande
Conv -> Conv : Assemble la convocation\net génère le PDF
Conv --> GW : 200 OK (PDF)
GW --> React : 200 OK
React --> Gest : Ouvre le PDF

@enduml
